.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 0402PA-0N8
* Inductance = 0.8nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-26GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 0402PA-0N8 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.026pF Ind=0.78nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=4
+ R2=0.061
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.00000218
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 0402PA-0N8

